"review_text":"The cane work on the back of the armchair is even tighter in person. It feels substantial without being bulky in a small apartment.","author_name":"Ananya S.","author_initials":"AS"}},"review_nF4yWH":{"type":"review","settings":{"review_text":"We bought the coffee table and matching sideboard. The sheesham grain has so much warmth under the lamp light. Delivery was extremely professional.","author_name":"Vikram M.","author_initials":"VM"}},"review_bA8twV":{"type":"review","settings":{"review_text":"Finally furniture that doesn't look like flat-pack cardboard. Solid wood smells incredible when you unbox it.","author_name":"Rohan & Neha","author_initials":"RN"}}},"block_order":["review_hBAUTb","review_nF4yWH","review_bA8twV"],"disabled":true,"name":"Custom Testimonials","settings":{"eyebrow":"From our customers","heading":"What people are saying"}},"custom_faq_wTRNfP":{"type":"custom-faq","blocks":{"question_geBCyq":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"How does white-glove delivery work?","answer":"Our delivery partners call you 24 hours in advance to schedule a 2-hour window. They bring the pieces inside, assemble anything requiring tools, and take all packaging materials away with them."}},"question_qMpkab":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"How should I clean and maintain the cane webbing?","answer":"Dust with a soft dry cloth. Twice a year, you can wipe it lightly with a damp cloth and mild soap to keep the natural rattan fibers supple. Avoid soaking."}},"question_x8kEMi":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Do you make custom sizes or finishes?","answer":"Because our batches are small and hand-crafted, we keep our catalog fixed. However, if you are outfitting an entire room, reach out to our studio team for bespoke options."}}},"block_order":["question_geBCyq","question_qMpkab","question_x8kEMi"],"name":"Custom FAQ","settings":{"eyebrow":"Got questions?","heading":"Everything you need to know"}}},"order":["custom_dews_hero_FpYYe